From: NWA50BE OpenWrt Project <noreply@invalid.example>
Subject: [PATCH] libssh: update to 0.12.2 security release
SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0-only

Update libssh to 0.12.2 with the four patches from OpenWrt 25.12
packages commit 409f2d51a99a. This fixes CVE-2026-0964 through
CVE-2026-0968, CVE-2026-15370 and CVE-2026-59843 through CVE-2026-59850;
the libssh.so.4 soname is unchanged.

---
 libs/libssh/Makefile                               |  8 +--
 ...o_init-when-the-CTR-DRBG-cannot-be-seeded.patch | 30 +++++++++
 ...bind-port-as-the-uint32-it-is-on-the-wire.patch | 74 ++++++++++++++++++++++
 ...-CTR-DRBG-against-use-before-it-is-seeded.patch | 65 +++++++++++++++++++
 ...rt-a-failed-initialisation-as-initialised.patch | 46 ++++++++++++++
 5 files changed, 219 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 libs/libssh/patches/0001-mbedtls-Fail-ssh_crypto_init-when-the-CTR-DRBG-cannot-be-seeded.patch
 create mode 100644 libs/libssh/patches/0002-messages-Parse-the-forwarding-bind-port-as-the-uint32-it-is-on-the-wire.patch
 create mode 100644 libs/libssh/patches/0003-mbedtls-Guard-the-CTR-DRBG-against-use-before-it-is-seeded.patch
 create mode 100644 libs/libssh/patches/0004-init-Do-not-report-a-failed-initialisation-as-initialised.patch

diff --git a/libs/libssh/Makefile b/libs/libssh/Makefile
--- a/libs/libssh/Makefile
+++ b/libs/libssh/Makefile
@@ -8,12 +8,12 @@
 include $(TOPDIR)/rules.mk
 
